{"id":17852,"author":"Tazz","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHello,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eI am going to be taking over the community removals seeing as Robin who was doing these stepped down.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eIn our recent Map development meeting have we been discussing a lot of things. And one the things we'd like to introduce is something we call \"The community removal\". We're doing this to get the community's feedback on maps, if they would like to keep the maps or not.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis thread will be rebooted every week with 4 new maps!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eLast week's results are following:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eUnix:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eKeep\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eRendezvous Redux:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eDragon Valley:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Remove\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eInfernus:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep (edit)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eSo, how does this little thing work?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eEvery week on this thread you will see 4 maps. These maps are being discussed if we should keep or not. Under me you will right now see four different maps. We, Map Developers would like you to share your thought of this map. Do you want this map to stay, or get removed? When you give your opinion on the map, please do motivate why you think like you do. Maybe we wont have to remove the map and instead make a certain change to it instead! And remember to\u0026nbsp;\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003ealways\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u0026nbsp;put the tag \"keep, edit or remove\", otherwise we Map developers may not understand your point and we get confused if you want to keep it or not.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThe following 4 maps that will either be removed/stay:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003eSector Six:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/sectorsix/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/sectorsix/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCrescent Subtle:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/crescentsubtle/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/crescentsubtle/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; widows: 1;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eVerdon Fortress:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/VerdonFortress/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/VerdonFortress/image\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; widows: 1;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClearmont:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/clearmont/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/clearmont/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis is when you can make a change, please motivate why you think like you do. Hopefully this will improve and create a better avicus experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eRegards\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThe Map Devs\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHello,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eI am going to be taking over the community removals seeing as Robin who was doing these stepped down.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eIn our recent Map development meeting have we been discussing a lot of things. And one the things we'd like to introduce is something we call \"The community removal\". We're doing this to get the community's feedback on maps, if they would like to keep the maps or not.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis thread will be rebooted every week with 4 new maps!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.44444465