ut the tag \"keep, edit or remove\", otherwise we Map developers may not understand your point and we get confused if you want to keep it or not.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThe following 4 maps that will either be removed/stay:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003eSector Six:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/sectorsix/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/sectorsix/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCrescent Subtle:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/crescentsubtle/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/crescentsubtle/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; widows: 1;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eVerdon Fortress:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/VerdonFortress/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/VerdonFortress/image\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"col