serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThe Map Devs\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1447003592,"title":"The community removal | #4","replies":[{"id":247225,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"1) Edit or remove. In my opinion, it lasts waaay too long and can be a stalemate. The gameplay is also pretty bland.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e2) Keep. Awesome gameplay and one of the few maps with TNT.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e3) Haven't really played it too much, but it isn't that unique.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e4) Keep. Awesome gameplay and loved by many players.","body_tagged":"1) Edit or remove. In my opinion, it lasts waaay too long and can be a stalemate. The gameplay is also pretty bland.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e2) Keep. Awesome gameplay and one of the few maps with TNT.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e3) Haven't really played it too much, but it isn't that unique.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e4) Keep. Awesome gameplay and loved by many players.","created_at":1447003747},{"id":247227,"author":"zero9178","body":"remove\u003cbr\u003ekeep\u003cbr\u003eremove\u003cbr\u003ekeep","body_tagged":"remove\u003cbr\u003ekeep\u003cbr\u003eremove\u003cbr\u003ekeep","created_at":1447003768},{"id":247228,"author":"Legoche","body":"Remove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove","body_tagged":"Remove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove","created_at":1447003886},{"id":247229,"author":"Subscriptor","body":"Sector six: Can i make a ctw edit to that possibly? KEEP\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCrescent: More TNT, it's a good map, just put more TNT. KEEP\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVerdon Fortress: Bad map, I dislike it.. Or make a drastic edit, but i dont believe it will work out. REMOVE\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eClearmont: Remove some water in the middle, and make void between 2 sides so you cant just simply put a boat and get the monument. For now, without the edit, REMOVE","body_tagged":"Sector six: Can i make a ctw edit to that possibly? KEEP\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCrescent: More TNT, it's a good map, just put more TNT. KEEP\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVerdon Fortress: Bad map, I dislike it.. Or make a drastic edit, but i dont believe it will work out. REMOVE\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eClearmont: Remove some water in the middle, and make void between 2 sides so you cant just simply put a boat and get the monument. For now, without the edit, REMOVE","created_at":1447003964},{"id":247254,"author":"AstroPizza","body":"Keep\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eRemove\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eRemove\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eKeep","body_tagged":"Keep\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eRemove\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eRemove\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eKeep","created_at":1447008978},{"id":247264,"author":"Indicado","body":"Keep\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eKeep/edit","body_tagged":"Keep\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eKeep/edit","created_at":1447010910},{"id":247390,"author":"Ingigo","body":"Remove\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eKeep\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eKeep","body_tagged":"Remove\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eKeep\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eKeep","created_at":1447020172},{"id":247730,"author":"fazer153","body":"Keep\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eIdk\u003cbr\u003eToo lazy to reason why","body_tagged":"Keep\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eRemove\u003cbr\u003eIdk\u003cbr\u003eToo lazy to reason why","created_at":1447103419},{"id":247731,"author":"Coco_stag","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eSector six: Keep\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif